> 
> Any help with this very much appreciated.

After the kernel.org security breech, due to the length of time that
it took to bring things back up (the kernel.org wiki's only were
brought back on line last month, over six months later), the android
source repo's were moved.

If you actually visited http://android.git.kernel.org with a web
browser, you'd see that it redirects to: 

	http://source.android.com/source/downloading.html

